，当厄于兵，宜善防之","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"fangji-q-8c10fe2b325907ff2df2","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-4d38decce6a6e1ea5685","layer":"original","quote":"谓应璩曰〖3〗：“君六十二，位为常伯〖4〗，而当有厄；先此一年，当独见一白狗，而旁人不见也","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":189,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45},{"id":"fangji-q-9bb07e9d3842d953326e","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-98ff5ab3b905f591a960","layer":"original","quote":"文帝为五官将，坐上会客三十余人；文帝问己年寿，又令遍相众宾","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":42},{"id":"fangji-q-a497c64a5f0c2185ae1e","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-299c120f1c4f91c789a9","layer":"original","quote":"朱建平，沛国人也。善相术〖1〗，于闾巷之间，效验非一。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"fangji-q-c47e678e494fa07f2e8e","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-18cfff7c6f84b0a80c2c","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：华佗之医诊，杜夔之声乐，朱建平之相术，周宣之相梦，管辂之术筮：诚皆玄妙之殊巧，非常之绝技矣。昔史迁著扁鹊、仓公、日者之传〖1〗，所以广异闻而表奇事也；故存录云尔。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":463,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84},{"id":"fangji-q-d32932647424df3c5059","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-03d8572d4b1c100b85d7","layer":"original","quote":"凡说此辈，无不如言；不能具详，故粗记数事。惟相司空王昶、征北将军程喜、中领军王肃有蹉跌云〖22〗。肃年六十二，疾笃；众医并以为不愈。肃夫人问以遗言，肃云：“建平相我逾七十，位至三公；今皆未也，将何虑乎！”而肃竟卒。","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107},{"id":"fangji-q-d5e3ff4aeb71c01806d5","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-6a27442282ea3603b9c9","layer":"original","quote":"吾与公达曾共使朱建平相〖7〗，建平曰：‘荀君虽少〖8〗，然当以后事付钟君","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":45,"end":81}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
